     "alt": "A table: cocoa in the Centre, South and South-West; coffee in the West and South-West; cotton in the North; bananas and oil palm in the South-West and Littoral; cattle in Adamawa, the North and North-West; fish on the coast, in rivers and in Lake Chad."
