     "type": "key",
     "style": "definition",
     "title": "Transport",
     "md": "**Transport** carries people and goods. By **road**: motorbikes, taxis, buses and lorries (the most used in Cameroon). By **rail**: trains, for example from Douala to Yaoundé and on to Ngaoundéré. By **water**: canoes, boats and ships; **Douala** and **Kribi** have ports. By **air**: aeroplanes; there are international airports at Douala and Yaoundé."
